Short:        Public Domain C Compiler
Author:       Steve Hawtin
Uploader:     ICStedman techie com
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       UPD Gold CD-ROM

NorthC 1.3	A public domain 'C' programming environment containing 
		all the programs required to develop 'C' code.  This is 
		version 1.3.  Changes include different examples, many 
		bug fixes, further documentation and some improvements.  
		The environment is supplied compressed and unpacks to two 
		disks.  Partial source is included.
		Authors: Steve Hawtin, Charlie Gibbs, Sozobon Ltd, The 
			 Software Distilary and many others.

		An update to NorthC V1.2 already on Aminet
		To use, unarchive the file then use the install program for floppy
		Or look at the file, NorthC 1.3/unpack.script for details of what
		needs to be installed where.


